	<text xml:lang="de">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/><placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName> 2. augusti: <persName>Comes Valdechius</persName> discessit a <persName ref="p20858">Guysio</persName> ad <persName ref="p8315">Condensem</persName> cum septinge<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>ntis equitibus.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ringravius asserit se non pugnaturum contra suae religionis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>homines.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z4"/>Fertur <persName ref="p20858">Guisius</persName> obsessurus <placeName ref="l367">Aureliam</placeName>, ubi <persName ref="p8315">Condeus</persName> se continet.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Scribitur ex <placeName ref="l15">Antverpia</placeName> <persName ref="p18465">reginam Angliae</persName> magnum instruere <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>exercitum, quem mittat in <placeName ref="l832">Galliam</placeName> in auxilium <persName ref="p8315">Condei</persName>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Causa huius apparatus fertur, quod <persName ref="p20858">Guisius</persName> impegerit <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>colaphum legato <persName ref="p18465">reginae Angliae</persName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">- <lb xml:id="p1z9"/><persName ref="p20412">Andelotus</persName> hac transivit ad principes protestantes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Creditur <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>eum auxilia impetraturum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Interceptae sunt literae cardinalis <placeName ref="l691">Lotharingii</placeName> e <placeName ref="l378">Lutetia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ad <persName ref="p18090">regen Navarrae</persName>, in quibus praeter multa alia archana <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>continetur, quod post mensem ignoret, undenam pecuniae com<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>parari possint ad sustinendum bellum..<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>.; quod <persName ref="p18090">Navarrae regina</persName> veniret in auxilium <persName ref="p8315">Condei</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>cum sex millibus peditum.</s>
					<note type="misc">Bis hierher von andrer Hand, das Folgende von <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> geschrieben.</note>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Wyter ist schryben har kummen, der herr von <placeName>A<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>nderes</placeName> habe in <placeName>Provincia</placeName> geschlagen die <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>bäpstler und sy erlegt, doch sye houptman <persName ref="p21319">Stu<lb xml:id="p2z4"/>der</persName> von <placeName ref="l473">S. Gallen</placeName> mitt 14 siner knächten umb<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>kummen...</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">Die <placeName ref="l41">Berner</placeName> zü<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>hind uff <lb xml:id="p2z7"/><placeName>Schaloni</placeName><note type="misc"><persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> glaubt beides nicht.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/>Es ist einer kummen von <placeName ref="l378">Parys</placeName>, sagt, die 1<lb xml:id="p2z9"/>5 fendli <persName>Frölichs</persName> syend näben <placeName ref="l378">Parys</placeName> hin ins <placeName>Gwys<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>a</placeName> läger zogen, also 1200 schwartz rütter <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>und [er] <placeName>Rogendorff</placeName>, 20 fenli lantzknächt under <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>dem <persName>Ryngraffen</persName>, und achte man, <placeName>Gwysa</placeName> wer<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>de schlahen wöllen oder <placeName ref="l367">Orliantz</placeName> belägern.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z14"/>Ist's waar, so ist darzu das lang beyten guͦt.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z15"/>Man hept an vil sagen von vil <lb xml:id="p2z16"/>rüstung <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>und tagens der <placeName ref="l2448">5 Orten</placeName>, <placeName ref="l760">Solenthurn</placeName> etc.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z18"/>Gott <lb xml:id="p2z19"/>gäb, dass ettwas guͦts gäbe.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z20"/>Und wie kumpt's, das ir mir <lb xml:id="p2z21"/>nüt schrybend vom concilio?</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Es sol doch in wäsen und <lb xml:id="p2z23"/>definitionibus gar sin.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse fehlt.]</note>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
